/*
 * Math symbol leader sequences: leader1 then M then the typst name.
 *
 *   leader1 + M + S U M            -> U+2211   (sym.sum)
 *   leader1 + M + A R R O W DOT R  -> U+2192   (sym.arrow.r)
 *
 * GENERATED by scripts/gen_leader_symbols.py from typst/codex sym.txt.
 * Do not edit by hand; re-run the script instead.
 *
 * Chosen by usefulness, NOT by whether they conflict: every symbol is
 * ranked by how often its section appears in ordinary maths, and a name
 * that clashes with one already taken is RENAMED rather than dropped
 * (arrow.r.bar -> arrowRBar, or the LaTeX command where one exists).
 * Only a symbol whose every spelling is taken is commented out.
 *
 * Greek is absent on purpose: leader1 + G covers all 25 letters, and
 * the same sequence with Shift gives the capitals.
 */

